    obo:IAO_0000116 "Examples: Acacia seyal: yellowish peeling bark || Alyssum linifolium: tiny yellowish ovate flat fruits || Euphorbia hirta: yellowish flowers || Heliotropium rariflorum: very brittle yellowish stems. Source frequency in current candidate set: 10."@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.upov.int/documents/d/upov/tgp-documents-en-tgp_14.pdf> ;
